    {
      "source": "Loading from and storing to a stream delegates to <code>Properties.load</code>\nand <code>Properties.store</code>, respectively, to be fully compatible with\nthe Unicode conversion as implemented by the JDK Properties class. As of JDK 6,\n<code>Properties.load/store</code> is also used for readers/writers, effectively\nturning this class into a plain backwards compatibility adapter.",
      "translation": "从流加载和存储到流分别委托给 `<code>Properties.load</code>` 和 `<code>Properties.store</code>`，以与 JDK Properties 类实现的 Unicode 转换完全兼容。自 JDK 6 起，`<code>Properties.load/store</code>` 也用于读取器和写入器，实际上将此类转换为一个普通的向后兼容性适配器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Allows for reading from any Reader and writing to any Writer, for example\nto specify a charset for a properties file. This is a capability that standard\n<code>java.util.Properties</code> unfortunately lacked up until JDK 5:\nYou were only able to load files using the ISO-8859-1 charset there.",
      "translation": "允许从任何 Reader 读取并向任何 Writer 写入，例如为属性文件指定字符集。这是标准 `<code>java.util.Properties</code>` 直到 JDK 5 之前不幸缺乏的功能：您只能使用 ISO-8859-1 字符集加载文件。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The persistence code that works with Reader/Writer follows the JDK's parsing\nstrategy but does not implement Unicode conversion, because the Reader/Writer\nshould already apply proper decoding/encoding of characters. If you prefer\nto escape unicode characters in your properties files, do <i>not</i> specify\nan encoding for a Reader/Writer (like ReloadableResourceBundleMessageSource's\n\"defaultEncoding\" and \"fileEncodings\" properties).",
      "translation": "与 Reader/Writer 配合使用的持久化代码遵循 JDK 的解析策略，但未实现 Unicode 转换，因为 Reader/Writer 应已对字符应用适当的解码/编码。如果您希望在属性文件中转义 Unicode 字符，请勿为 Reader/Writer 指定编码（例如不要设置 ReloadableResourceBundleMessageSource 的\"defaultEncoding\"和\"fileEncodings\"属性）。",
      "count": 2
    },
